    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped, and must hack your way through multiple levels of security to gain your freedom. Each level has 16 networks, and each network has 14 nodes. Only one node leads to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist, casual cyberpunk RPG with RNG-based mechanics. Click on nodes to hack them, defend against ICE that attack you, and upgrade your Network Scanner and ICEBreaker to continue your journey. Can you make it out?</p>",
